# Cross-repo siblings cloned by setup-dev-env at workspace-lock-pinned
# revisions (see codetracer-specs/Testing/Cross-Repo-CI-Integration.md).
#
# Only what repro.nim declares, and so what repro.lock pins: the Nim
# implementation of the format, which the codetracer_trace_writer_nim adapter
# crate, the cross-language fixture producer and the cross-implementation
